                    <tr><td>Basement finishing</td><td>$25,000–$40,000</td><td>$50,000–$80,000</td><td>$90,000–$150,000</td><td>Includes egress window if adding bedroom; waterproofing is separate</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Deck/porch addition</td><td>$12,000–$22,000</td><td>$28,000–$55,000</td><td>$60,000–$120,000</td><td>Composite decking adds 30–40% to material costs vs pressure-treated</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Window replacement (per window)</td><td>$600–$900 installed</td><td>$1,000–$1,800 installed</td><td>$2,000–$4,000+ installed</td><td>Non-standard openings (common in pre-1960 Delaware County homes) add $300–$800/window</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Whole-home renovation</td><td>$80–$120/sq ft</td><td>$130–$200/sq ft</td><td>$220–$350+/sq ft</td><td>Load-bearing wall removal, electrical/plumbing upgrades, structural changes substantially increase cost</td></tr>
