              <div class="post-callout">
                <p><strong>2026 cost note:</strong> Material costs in the Philadelphia metro have seen 8–15% increases since 2024 driven by tariff pressures on lumber, steel, and imported fixtures. ProBrothers quotes are locked for 30 days from issue date. Projects starting later than 60 days from quote may require a materials cost review. Always build a 15–20% contingency into your budget — not because contractors pad estimates, but because older homes reveal what they've been hiding once demolition begins.</p>
